sequenceDiagram
  participant CEX
  participant Adapter as Broker adapter
  participant Workflow as Process-fill workflow
  participant Ledger as Immutable fill ledger
  participant Inventory as Inventory / recovery projection
  participant Repository as StateRepository
  participant Events as Event publisher

  CEX->>Adapter: Execution event or trade-history row
  Adapter->>Workflow: Canonical Fill + commission completeness
  Workflow->>Ledger: Append by stable market/trade identity
  alt New fill
    Ledger-->>Workflow: Accepted immutable fact
    Workflow->>Inventory: Apply exact base/quote/fee deltas
    Inventory-->>Workflow: New projection or invariant failure
    Workflow->>Repository: Save state/checkpoint
    Workflow->>Events: Publish fill-recorded / order-progress event
  else Identical duplicate
    Ledger-->>Workflow: Duplicate; no economic change
  else Same ID, changed facts
    Ledger-->>Workflow: Conflict
    Workflow->>Events: Publish market-paused diagnostic
  end
  Note over Ledger,Inventory: Unknown fee is not zero; third-asset fee pauses the market